Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.87,0:00:53.20,Creditage,,0,0,0,,{\pos(292.83,378)}Timing: usotsuki
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.87,0:00:53.20,Creditage,,0,0,0,,{\pos(292.83,415.5)}Translation: Puto
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.14,0:01:17.06,Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,468)}The Dictator Switch
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.03,0:01:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, go for the handle!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.82,0:01:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen up! If you don't make it to third base, I'll make you regret it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.28,0:01:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.57,0:01:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Play ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.42,0:01:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.25,0:01:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.96,0:01:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Strike! Batter out! Change!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.42,0:01:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.22,0:01:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Out! Game and set!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.68,0:01:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,They totally beat us!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.26,0:01:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,They scored 18 runs! How is this possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.77,0:01:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And you call yourselves players?! You were so pathetic on the field!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.90,0:01:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Especially Nobita!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.27,0:02:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,15 out of 18 runs they scored were your fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.15,0:02:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And We'd have scored five more runs if it weren't for your clumsiness!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.70,0:02:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a disaster! We lost 20 runs thanks to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.20,0:02:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,That many?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.87,0:02:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,As punishment, do 20 laps around the field!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.04,0:02:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.50,0:02:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm too tired to run!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.54,0:02:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, you were the pitcher...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.46,0:02:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you just say?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.51,0:02:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't run, I'll {\i1}make{\i0} you run!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.01,0:02:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait! Nobita, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.39,0:02:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Gian's pretty harsh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.22,0:02:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck, Nobita.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.85,0:02:41.61,Default,,0,0,0,,This is so frustrating!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.36,0:02:45.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Why does this always have to happen to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.11,0:02:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,That's because you're a terrible player, Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.95,0:02:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,No way! Even you, Doraemon...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.91,0:02:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on! If you don't want it to happen again, let's go train!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.83,0:02:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.59,0:03:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Because Gian's the problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.92,0:03:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,If only he wasn't around.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.47,0:03:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,If Gian were to just disappear, I could live my life happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.64,0:03:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Why couldn't he just move out?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.69,0:03:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,If that's what you think...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.77,0:03:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let's give it a try.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.85,0:03:28.57,Tool,,0,0,30,,{\fad(600,0)\a6\c&HD3AFCA}Dictator Switch
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.19,0:03:28.57,Default,,0,0,180,,The Dictator Switch!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.53,0:03:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Dictator Switch? What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.70,0:03:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,A dictator in the future had this made.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.66,0:03:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,A dictator?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.00,0:03:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The term dictator refers to someone who is an absolute ruler  invested with disproportionate powers...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.74,0:03:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,and he singlehandedly controls the country,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.50,0:03:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,And a dictator in the future used this switch...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.38,0:03:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,...to get rid of anyone who opposed him or or stood in his way!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.14,0:04:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean they "?"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.56,0:04:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Obviously, they vanish into thin air, as if they did not even existed to begin with!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.03,0:04:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Did not even existed to begin with...?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.45,0:04:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Wha...!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.53,0:04:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,The fly's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.49,0:04:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,See? Easy, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.99,0:04:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,With this, you can make anyone who bothers you disappear
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.33,0:04:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,and you'll be able to live in a happier world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.38,0:04:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.38,0:04:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,,...making someone disappear like that is kind of harsh...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.14,0:04:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Either way, I'll have to give it some thought and see what I'll do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.35,0:04:41.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, right. Do that then.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.74,0:05:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Gian may be a pretty bad guy, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.00,0:05:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't just make the poor guy disappear like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.17,0:05:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got to have some positive quality...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.09,0:05:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I dunno...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.80,0:05:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a brute and a bully, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.51,0:05:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.06,0:05:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Got you. Don't even think about trying to get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.56,0:05:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.85,0:05:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What else? I want you to run the other 10 laps!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.61,0:05:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahh! Don't be so mean!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.49,0:05:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Nobita!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.95,0:05:35.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave me alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.07,0:05:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No way! I won't let you off this one!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.00,0:05:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nowhere left to run. Prepare yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.14,0:06:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Gian, disappear!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.61,0:06:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.66,0:06:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He's really gone...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.76,0:06:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I did something really awful...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.22,0:06:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I erased Gian...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.43,0:06:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Nobita-{\i1}san{\i0}? You're kind of pale.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.02,0:06:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.73,0:06:51.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I... made Gian...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.90,0:06:54.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Gian? Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.57,0:06:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Who, you say? Gian! Takeshi Gōda!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.74,0:07:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The guy with the big body who sings really badly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.78,0:07:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't sound familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.08,0:07:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You really don't know him?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.58,0:07:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Teacher!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.96,0:07:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Gōda-{\i1}kun{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.09,0:07:15.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.71,0:07:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,There's never been any Gōda-{\i1}kun{\i0} in my class.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.47,0:07:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,But Gian...!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.01,0:07:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never had a student by that name.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.01,0:07:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,B-But...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.39,0:07:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about, Nobi-{\i1}kun{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.23,0:07:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.31,0:07:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,No... No way...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.06,0:07:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Takeshi?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.48,0:07:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. Takeshi Gōda-{\i1}kun{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.27,0:07:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I don't have any kid by that name.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.53,0:07:40.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I only have a daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.49,0:07:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Gian? Who are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.45,0:07:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm talking about Gōda-{\i1}kun{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.24,0:07:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You know him?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.54,0:07:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I don't know him either...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.58,0:07:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Gōda-{\i1}kun{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.67,0:07:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Takeshi Gōda!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.96,0:07:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Gian!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.58,0:07:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Never heard of him...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.59,0:07:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.47,0:08:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody remembers Gian...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.01,0:08:02.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita-{\i1}san{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.55,0:08:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita-{\i1}san{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.76,0:08:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.72,0:08:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all right, Nobita-{\i1}san{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.77,0:08:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, more or less.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.35,0:08:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You look tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.40,0:08:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You should probably take a hot bath, then go to bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.65,0:08:19.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.11,0:08:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, you can use this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.28,0:08:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.20,0:08:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a bath salt.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.78,0:08:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,They're very relaxing and they smell really nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.20,0:08:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.16,0:08:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You're welcome. Rest well, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.04,0:08:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,See you tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.67,0:08:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. See you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.14,0:08:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What now? He didn't just disappear, it's as if he never existed...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.77,0:08:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.44,0:08:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't "aah" me, you moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.90,0:09:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your fault we lost today!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.40,0:09:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,So in a world without Gian, Suneo took his place?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.41,0:09:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your fault we lost 20 runs, Nobita!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.54,0:09:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And if you hadn't screwed up so much, we could've won 7 more runs!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.21,0:09:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,This is unreal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.17,0:09:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you on about?! As punishment, you have to run 25 laps around the field!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.63,0:09:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,He's even worse than Gian!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.71,0:09:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't think you'll get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.68,0:09:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Geez! Suneo, disappear!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.39,0:09:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.73,0:09:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.98,0:09:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Suneo?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.53,0:09:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I did it again...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.07,0:09:45.11,Default,,0,0,0,,No way...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.70,0:09:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not... It's not my fault...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.66,0:09:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.17,0:10:04.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't use it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.13,0:10:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll return the switch to Doraemon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.06,0:10:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Nobita!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.60,0:10:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.64,0:10:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.19,0:10:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.23,0:10:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your fault we lost today's game!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.06,0:10:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.36,0:10:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,As punishment, do 20 laps around the field!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.11,0:10:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, start running!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.15,0:10:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah! Hurry up and start running...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.74,0:10:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough! Leave me alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.74,0:10:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Or I'll make you disappear!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.29,0:10:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.25,0:10:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody's the same...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.46,0:10:42.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobi-{\i1}chan{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.05,0:10:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Sheesh! The entire day playing around, yet you still haven't done your homework, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.97,0:10:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you always do the same thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.51,0:10:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you listening to me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.55,0:10:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.18,0:10:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, don't make me angry today!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.35,0:10:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring back the two you erased?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.23,0:11:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I beg you, Doraemon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.90,0:11:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't {\i1}really{\i0} want them to disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.11,0:11:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Even then...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.57,0:11:08.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, I beg you...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.03,0:11:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.32,0:11:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no going back!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.82,0:11:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the one who wanted to make Gian disappear, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.29,0:11:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.00,0:11:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Either way, there's nothing that can be done. You'll be better off if you just forget about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.92,0:11:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't just forget them...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.80,0:11:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What a terrible switch...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.10,0:11:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Whenever I feel trapped, I get tempted...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.56,0:11:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too dangerous to take it with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.48,0:11:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Why does everybody pick on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.69,0:11:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The entire day playing, yet your homework's not done yet, right?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.11,0:11:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's your fault, Nobita! 20 laps around the field!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.91,0:11:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You klutz! It's your fault we lost!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.20,0:11:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You suck!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.75,0:12:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's your fault!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.21,0:12:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it! Stop it already!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.00,0:12:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't make me use the switch!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.00,0:12:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But wasn't this what you wanted, Nobita-kun?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.47,0:12:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's all your fault.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.59,0:12:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Do... Doraemon? Even you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.64,0:12:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Pay attention!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.55,0:12:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You're horrible, Nobita-san!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.89,0:12:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's your fault!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.72,0:12:18.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Enough, Nobita!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.56,0:12:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's all your fault!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.73,0:12:21.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nobita-san...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.02,0:12:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.73,0:12:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Why's everybody blaming me?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.48,0:12:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Man... Everybody, anybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.32,0:12:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Just disappear!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.21,0:12:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It's kind of quiet...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.18,0:12:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.27,0:13:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Doraemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.24,0:13:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nobody here...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.15,0:13:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be... No way...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.53,0:13:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure everybody's on the field...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.95,0:13:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.37,0:13:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,That's gotta be it...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.59,0:13:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Shizuka-{\i1}chan{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.34,0:13:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Shizuka-{\i1}chan{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.76,0:13:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It can't be... Even Shizuka-chan...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.22,0:13:40.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Shizuka-{\i1}chan{\i0}? If you're there, please answer!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.27,0:13:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.35,0:13:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.90,0:13:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.40,0:13:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Anybody?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.48,0:13:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Is anybody there?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.04,0:14:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.79,0:14:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,There's really nobody...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.58,0:14:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What now? What have I done?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.75,0:14:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I've erased every single human being in the entire world!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.86,0:15:01.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I've erased...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.87,0:15:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,...the entire world!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.71,0:15:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Men don't cry, Nobita Nobi. What's done is done, can't be helped.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.30,0:15:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,And thinking about it, my friends won't be able to pick on me anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.52,0:15:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,And Mom and the teacher won't be able to scold me anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.52,0:15:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Right! Now I can do anything I want!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.15,0:15:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the master of the Earth!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.65,0:15:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a dictator!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.11,0:15:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.53,0:15:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,First I'll eat something good, to build up energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.13,0:16:01.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm full.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.34,0:16:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't eat as much as I thought...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.93,0:16:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to play!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.94,0:16:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted this car so much...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.53,0:16:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.11,0:16:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Being able to do whatever I want is really cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.16,0:16:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Now every toy in the world is mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.05,0:16:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.72,0:16:43.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Doraemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.26,0:16:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I should've left Doraemon so he could help me...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.77,0:16:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing on TV...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.82,0:17:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Since there's nobody...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.20,0:17:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,As usual...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.16,0:17:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,When I can do anything I want...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.41,0:17:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing I actually {\i1}want{\i0} to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.79,0:17:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.15,0:17:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I can get into all the attractions, and without having to get in line.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.41,0:17:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything... Everything's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.57,0:19:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so dark everywhere...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.99,0:19:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.70,0:19:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nobody around...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.30,0:19:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I'll sleep with the lights on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.18,0:19:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! A blackout!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.66,0:20:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see... Who should I call to fix the blackout?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.79,0:20:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.96,0:20:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter who I call...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.79,0:20:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,...nobody's around to answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.18,0:20:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nobi-chan, do your homework!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.51,0:20:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nobita, don't screw up!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.64,0:20:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nobita, you klutz!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.43,0:20:21.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Do 20 laps around the field!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.10,0:20:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Right, start running!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.52,0:20:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You look tired...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.44,0:20:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You look tired...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.44,0:20:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.57,0:20:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so tired...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.78,0:20:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Shizuka-{\i1}chan{\i0} was right, this smells great...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.58,0:20:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And it feels so good...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.72,0:20:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.60,0:21:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,This has to be a nightmare!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.81,0:21:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,In the morning...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.98,0:21:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll see Shizuka-{\i1}chan{\i0} again...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.28,0:21:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Shizuka-{\i1}chan{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.70,0:21:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Anybody...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.41,0:21:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I need some company, anybody will do!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.42,0:21:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Even Gian will do...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.96,0:21:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody, please...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.17,0:21:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't... I can't live alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.17,0:21:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Do you understand it now, Nobita-kun?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.05,0:21:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.01,0:21:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If you make everyone who bothers you disappear...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.44,0:21:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...you'll end up completely alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.44,0:21:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.19,0:21:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.78,0:21:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Then you regret what you did?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.49,0:22:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.53,0:22:02.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry for scaring you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.46,0:22:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.25,0:22:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I missed you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.21,0:22:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry, I didn't mean to erase you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.75,0:22:14.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all right, now you understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.26,0:22:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, this Dictator Switch...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.01,0:22:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,wasn't made to make a person into a dictator
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.97,0:22:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,but for people to understand why being a dictator is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.85,0:22:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.19,0:22:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, get everything back to normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.73,0:22:34.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.67,0:22:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobi-{\i1}chan{\i0}, look how you left the dining room?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.84,0:22:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Go clean it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.84,0:22:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom's angry as usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.72,0:23:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You better go clean it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.77,0:23:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Play!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.52,0:23:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,All right! All right, all right, all right!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.61,0:23:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! That's no good, keep your eyes on the ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.24,0:23:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,One more time!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.53,0:23:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,My mom bought it for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.99,0:23:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll have to lend it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.08,0:23:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Look! The klutz is practicing!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.83,0:23:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,If you screw up in the next game, I'll beat you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.42,0:23:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Gonna beat me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.63,0:23:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Gian.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.01,0:23:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with Nobita...?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.64,0:23:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what happened...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.01,0:23:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,This noisy neighborhood is so much fun!
